swer.type/math} :answer/value "2v\\sqrt{1 + 8u^{2}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186116666} :answer-field/id #uuid "9cdad585-8c40-5273-9afc-8b7048317533" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186116661}] :question/id #uuid "a126827b-bc56-516e-a030-80e53d51bfcf" :question/math-academy-id "q-109941" :question/problem "$∬_(D)AAAAAAAAdA, D = {(u, v): 0 \\le u \\le 2, 0 \\le v \\le 2}$\n\nThe integral above gives the surface area of the parametric surface $r(u, v) = ⟨u^{2}, u - v^{2}, v^{2}⟩$ for $0 \\le u \\le 2$ and $0 \\le v \\le 2$. What is the missing expression?"}]}
